This README is for Developpers of aGBe.
---------------------------------------

Thank you for helping to dev aGBe. As it will make life easier for everyone please take 
into consideration when making changes to the code, or using CVS.

	o Please keep code properly formatted, and Nicely spaced. (Makes the +diff tool 
more effective.)
	o Please Comment on big changes when commiting Files to the CVS.
	o Please do not post anything that should be here: (Like)
		- Anything that shouldn't be in the CVS
		- Binaries
		- Batch Files
		- Tmp/Obj Files
		- Any Scripts that arent official.
		- Any Files that arent directly involved with the project.

(this may sound obvious, but Its tough to erase these files once they're up, so its best 
to take procaution and keep your directories clean, and not upload anything bad!)

Also, Please make use of the Sourceforge Project page, as well as the Gambase forums. 
These things are great tools for communication. We might as well take advantage of them!

Thank you all.

gxd (Project Leader) 
